# Design pattern properties defining problem-solution mappings
### Design pattern properties

# Property defining problem solved by design pattern
eda:solvesProblem a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain eda:DesignPattern ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:label "solves problem" .

